{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06074","headline":"和陈监四郎秋雨中思从弟据 · 王维","name":"和陈监四郎秋雨中思从弟据","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫋嫋秋风动，凄凄烟雨繁。\n声连鳷鹊观，色暗凤凰原。\n细柳疎高阁，轻槐落洞门。\n九衢行欲断，万井寂无喧。\n忽有愁霖唱，更陈多露言。\n平原思令弟，康乐谢贤昆。\n逸兴方三接，衰颜强七奔。\n相如今老病，归守茂陵园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}